{{also|под}}
==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|подо-}} {{i|before certain consonant clusters}}

===Etymology===
Inherited from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*podъ-}}; see {{m|sla-pro|*podъ}} for further information.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|под-|ann=y}} {{i|before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|пот-|ann=под-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|по́д-|ann=y}} {{i|when stressed, before vowels and voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|по́т-|ann=по́д-}} {{i|when stressed, before voiceless consonants}}

