====Usage notes====
* In the meaning of ''closer'', only use под- when the subject is in the sight range of the object of interest, and then moves even closer towards it.
:* {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[подойти|подошла́]] [[к]] [[памятник|па́мятнику]].|I walked up to the statue. (I already was in the same room or space with it, and then walked closer to it.)}}
:* {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] [[прийти|пришла́]] [[к]] [[памятник|па́мятнику]].|I arrived at the statue. (I came to the statue from somewhere further.)}}

